          In This Guide
        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#dust" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. The Dust Problem</a>
          <a href="#types" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. Types of Drywall Sander</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. Our 7 Top Picks Reviewed</a>
          <a href="#technique" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. Sanding Technique</a>
          <a href="#vacuum" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Vacuum Requirements</a>
